    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="meta">Last Updated: October 7, 2025</p>

    <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
    <p>
      Welcome to ZenitsuBot's Privacy Policy. We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal data. This privacy policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you use our Discord bot.
    </p>

    <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
    
    <h3>2.1 Discord User Information</h3>
    <p>When you use ZenitsuBot, we collect the following information from Discord:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>User ID (Discord's unique identifier for your account)</li>
      <li>Username and discriminator</li>
      <li>Avatar URL</li>
      <li>Server (Guild) IDs where the bot is present</li>
      <li>Role information within servers</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>2.2 Usage Data</h3>
    <p>We automatically collect certain information when you interact with the Bot:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Commands executed and their parameters</li>
      <li>Timestamps of interactions</li>
      <li>Server and channel IDs where commands are used</li>
      <li>Error logs and debugging information</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>2.3 Economy and Game Data</h3>
    <p>For features like the economy system, we store:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Virtual currency balances</li>
      <li>Inventory items</li>
      <li>Transaction history</li>
      <li>Game statistics and scores</li>
      <li>Daily rewards and cooldowns</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>2.4 Anime Tracking Data</h3>
    <p>If you use anime tracking features, we store:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Anime series you're tracking</li>
      <li>Alert preferences and notification settings</li>
      <li>Watch history and favorites</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>We use the collected information for the following purposes:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>To provide and maintain the Bot's functionality</li>
      <li>To process your commands and requests</li>
      <li>To manage the virtual economy system</li>
      <li>To send notifications about anime episodes</li>
      <li>To generate leaderboards and statistics</li>
      <li>To improve and optimize the Bot's performance</li>
      <li>To detect and prevent abuse or violations of our Terms of Service</li>
      <li>To provide customer support</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Data Storage and Security</h2>
    <p>
      We implement appropriate technical and organizational security measures to protect your data against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. Your data is stored in secure databases with encryption and access controls.
    </p>
    <p>
      However, no method of transmission over the internet or electronic storage is 100% secure. While we strive to protect your personal information, we cannot guarantee its absolute security.
    </p>

    <h2>5. Data Sharing and Disclosure</h2>
    <p>We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. We may share your information only in the following circumstances:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>With your consent:</strong> When you explicitly agree to share your information</li>
      <li><strong>For legal reasons:</strong> If required by law, court order, or government request</li>
      <li><strong>To protect rights:</strong> To protect the rights, property, or safety of ZenitsuBot, our users, or others</li>
      <li><strong>Third-party services:</strong> We use third-party APIs (Discord, anime databases, game APIs) which have their own privacy policies</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>6. Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>ZenitsuBot integrates with several third-party services:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Discord:</strong> The Bot operates on Discord's platform and is subject to Discord's Privacy Policy</li>
      <li><strong>AniList/MyAnimeList:</strong> For anime data and tracking</li>
      <li><strong>Steam API:</strong> For game information and statistics</li>
      <li><strong>YouTube/Spotify:</strong> For music playback features</li>
    </ul>
    <p>These services have their own privacy policies, and we encourage you to review them.</p>

    <h2>7. Data Retention</h2>
    <p>
      We retain your personal information only for as long as necessary to provide the Bot's services and comply with legal obligations. Economy data and statistics may be retained longer for historical and analytical purposes.
    </p>

    <h2>8. Your Data Rights</h2>
    <p>You have the following rights regarding your personal data:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Access:</strong> Request a copy of the data we hold about you</li>
      <li><strong>Correction:</strong> Request correction of inaccurate data</li>
      <li><strong>Deletion:</strong> Request deletion of your data (subject to legal obligations)</li>
      <li><strong>Objection:</strong> Object to certain types of data processing</li>
      <li><strong>Portability:</strong> Request transfer of your data to another service</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      To exercise these rights, please contact us through our Discord server or email. We will respond to your request within 30 days.
    </p>

    <h2>9. Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      The Bot is not intended for users under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe we have collected information from a child under 13, please contact us immediately.
    </p>

    <h2>10. International Data Transfers</h2>
    <p>
      Your information may be transferred to and processed in countries other than your country of residence. These countries may have different data protection laws. By using the Bot, you consent to such transfers.
    </p>

    <h2>11. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
    <p>
      Our web dashboard uses cookies and similar tracking technologies to maintain your login session and improve your experience. You can control cookie settings through your browser preferences.
    </p>

    <h2>12. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of significant changes by posting the new Privacy Policy on this page and updating the "Last Updated" date.
    </p>

    <h2>13. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>
      If you have any questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy or our data practices, please contact us:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Through our Discord server</li>
      <li>Via email at: privacy@zenitsu.rohan.host</li>
      <li>Through the contact form on our website</li>
    </ul>

